   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "But this time I looked at the envelope.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "There was a coffee ring on it.",
   "nefes": 0.6,
   "mark": "ring",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "And only two people ever called me Ant.",
   "nefes": 0.6,
   "mark": "ant",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I put it on the table.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Defne did not even pretend.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"You were nineteen and alone on a crane, Ant.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "I wanted them to stop you.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "Before a building did.\"",
   "nefes": 0.7,
   "mark": "confess",
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "I wanted to be angry.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "It started raining instead.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "We sat in Daisy's cabin and shared one phone, like when we were kids.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Demolition Master, one turn each.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": "game",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "She did Grandpa's voice.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Plan first.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then press the button.\"",
   "nefes": 0.5,
   "mark": "plan",
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I'll help you finish the list,\" she said.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"As your engineer.\"",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she got serious.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
